        "created_at": "2014-05-26T14:12:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, I was re-reading Bunker's bio on the Sotm website, and the following struck me as strange:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SotM Website\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n SotM Website:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>Tyler “Bunker” Vance now acts as Legacy’s right hand man and the strategic brains behind most of the Freedom Five’s mission planning.</span></p>\n<span>\n</span></blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><span>This seems to be a significant ability, but there is no card in his deck that represents it. So, are their any other abilities from other characters that their deck doesn't represent?</span></p>",
